yengine/bevy/deployments","created_at":"2020-01-18T21:13:55Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T22:52:09Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T23:54:15Z","git_url":"git://github.com/bevyengine/bevy.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:bevyengine/bevy.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy","homepage":"https://bevy.org","size":153505,"stargazers_count":43454,"watchers_count":43454,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":4270,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":3179,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["bevy","game-development","game-engine","gamedev","open-source","rust"],"visibility":"public","forks":4270,"open_issues":3179,"watchers":43454,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/pulls/16272","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/16272","diff_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/16272.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/16272.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"# Objective\r\n\r\n- Currently when you attempt to change the cursor_grab_mode it caches the new value whether the cursor grab succeeded or failed. This change handles the Result being returned by set_cursor_grab and changes the cursor_grab_mode back to the cached version in case of an Error. \r\n- Creates a way to handle #16237 and #16238\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\n- I changed the signature of winit_windows attempt_grab to return the Result<(), ExternalError> that winit set_cursor_grab returns. The system that calls attempt_grab now checks if there's an error returned, and if there is it sets the grab_mode back to the cached version (similar to what hit_test does a few lines down). \r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- I tested using this system that previously would not correctly lock the mouse on Ubuntu/x11\r\n```\r\npub fn lock_mouse(mut primary_window: Query<&mut Window, With<PrimaryWindow>>) {\r\n    let window = &mut primary_window.single_mut();\r\n    if window.focused {\r\n        window.cursor.grab_mode = CursorGrabMode::Confined;\r\n        window.cursor.visible = false\r\n    } else {\r\n        window.cursor.grab_mode = CursorGrabMode::None;\r\n        window.cursor.visible = true;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n- I only tested on Ubuntu with x11","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/16272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/16272/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"Knar33","id":4692561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTI1NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4692561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33","html_url":"https://github.com/Knar33","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Knar33/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-